  "title": "Protocol-Governed Computing: Reference Implementation (composed platform)",
  "description": "<p>The composed Protocol-Governed Computing reference implementation: a single governance surface assembling seven governed domains over 410 protocol artifacts, including mutually unrelated business domains. This deposit identifies the <em>composition</em> — the artifact to which claims about domain independence and closure refer — rather than any single component repository. The nine component repositories are archived separately and related here as parts.</p><p>Cite this version DOI when citing the reference implementation as evidence.</p>",
